==Strategy==
Allow the St. Pigges to stack using [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]]. With time, you should be able to upgrade your Worker Cat to level 8 and max your wallet. As long as you have a strong lineup, you should be able to enter Kite Cat's blindspot to kill her, then destroy the base. Wave units and LD units will certainly be most helpful against Master A, and strong tanks such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Jamiera Cat]] should be able to enter Kite Cat's blindspot and deal a good amount of damage before they die.

If you are a beginner and do not have high level units, [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark Cats]] are a must here, as they will halt the advance of the hardest pusher in this stage, Gory Dark. [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] are two common ones who can halt and completely stop his advance, although Bomber will not work pre-TF.

